 🔸 8. Queue vs Stack

| Feature    | Queue           | Stack          |
|  |  |  |
| Order      | FIFO            | LIFO           |
| Insertions | Rear            | Top            |
| Deletions  | Front           | Top            |
| Use Cases  | BFS, scheduling | DFS, recursion |



